4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TGHB1O4grOsQ7kNvwHCVz60&_nc_oc=AdqpiQJhnnNhTOmOdwvxyIT03LOB5ix1EZ5DtqeHVH3vQ7GLQ18jZ0Y_k1uIKegilkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG9bmsJXO42FE85MWtM_DobMlipnCkQhOeUCAL8K8FzQA&oe=6A973DD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ft_sSJfn65oQ7kNvwGRA35J&_nc_oc=Adr_OW7CmXEdTk5ArZ88w2JcqqnWAdrv3QLkUwVhj7gDCawWS2RaiMXVwdoJJKetsIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHk-Ui6mgQBYNybYPM5sVKYUeFgRdYCP21hb-RA9EtxVA&oe=6A9742B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N32NizUi7CMQ7kNvwGXybi_&_nc_oc=AdpD21XAuDcB5Ns3Bx9cT42J1jiWYB0ZvdSGlR3wYjgr4l0P5cJvV95yr_pTYa8nI5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGeU6MseS-V-8KERTodradj-EX0TLkIsGl_G-MX2_b9Fg&oe=6A975055"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p